<h3 id="the-styles-decorator">The @Styles Decorator</h3>

<p>The @Styles decorator can extract multiple style settings into a single method that can be called directly where the component is declared. Through the @Styles decorator, you can quickly define and reuse custom styles. It’s used to quickly define and reuse custom styles.</p>

<ul>
  <li>Currently @Styles only supports common attributes and common events.</li>
  <li>@Styles methods don’t support parameters.</li>
</ul>

<blockquote>
  <p>Starting from API version 9, this decorator supports use in ArkTS cards.</p>
</blockquote>

